00:18:08,550 --> 00:18:10,440
and that the path to revenge leads to hell

286
00:18:10,680 --> 00:18:14,560
because I don't see the harm in that.

287
00:18:16,560 --> 00:18:22,360
My new body opens its eyes

288
00:18:19,080 --> 00:18:22,360
