293
00:18:37,960 --> 00:18:46,920
By sticking to this thought, I will get it done

294
00:18:41,920 --> 00:18:46,920
by my own hands.

295
00:19:17,800 --> 00:19:23,760
Returning to my body opened my eyes,

296
00:19:20,520 --> 00:19:23,760
